  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Chef has a knapsack with a volume capacity of VVV.\n\nThere are NNN items where the ithi^{th}ith item has volume XiX_iXi​ and value YiY_iYi​ (Xi⋅Yi≤109)(X_i\\cdot Y_i \\leq 10^9)(Xi​⋅Yi​≤109).\n\nNote that each item can be selected **at most once**.\n\nFind the **maximum value** Chef can get without exceeding the volume capacity of knapsack.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of multiple lines of input.\n\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers NNN and VVV — the number of items and the volume capacity of knapsack.\nThe next NNN lines describe the items. The ithi^{th}ith of these NNN lines contains two space-separated integers XiX_iXi​ and YiY_iYi​, denoting the volume and value respectively.\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output on a new line, the maximum value Chef can get without exceeding the capacity of knapsack.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1001 \\leq T \\leq 1001≤T≤100",
      "1≤N≤1001 \\leq N \\leq 1001≤N≤100",
      "1≤V,Xi,Yi≤1091 \\leq V,X_i,Y_i \\leq 10^91≤V,Xi​,Yi​≤109",
      "1≤Xi⋅Yi≤1091 \\leq X_i\\cdot Y_i \\leq 10^91≤Xi​⋅Yi​≤109",
      "The sum of NNN over all test cases won't exceed 100100100."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2\n4 500000000\n1 1\n2 200000000\n4 250000000\n499999995 2\n4 500000001\n1 1\n2 200000000\n4 250000000\n499999995 2",
        "output": "450000001\n450000002",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: Chef can select items 1,2,31, 2, 31,2,3 with total volume 1+2+4=71+2+4=71+2+4=7 and value 1+200000000+250000000=4500000011+200000000+250000000=4500000011+200000000+250000000=450000001.\nTest case 222: Chef can select items 2,3,42, 3, 42,3,4 with total volume 2+4+499999995=5000000012+4+499999995=5000000012+4+499999995=500000001 and value 200000000+250000000+2=450000002200000000+250000000+2=450000002200000000+250000000+2=450000002."
      }
    ]
